  read=production  explicit orders (A=0,B=1,C=2) -> out: (((0 1 2) 2) ((0 2 1) 5) ((1 2 0) 2) ((2 1 0) 2)) | BSP 2  DRAIN 2  DRAIN(rev install) 5  => ORDER-DEPENDENT
  read=base-join  explicit orders (A=0,B=1,C=2) -> out: (((0 1 2) 5) ((0 2 1) 5) ((1 2 0) 5) ((2 1 0) 5)) | BSP 5  DRAIN 5  DRAIN(rev install) 5  => order-independent
  direct: (tagged-cell-read (tagged-cell-value 5 ((1 . 2))) wv=1 max) = 2 ; base ⊔ entry = 5
