== B3: retry after invalidation, grow-only invalidated set (two-phase set, Shapiro 2011)
  after assume b0: live=1; after invalidate b0: live=0; after re-assume b0: live=0 (b0 can never be live again)
  a retry needs a FRESH bit: re-assume as b1 -> live=2
